          "name": "analyze_moment",
          "canonical_hash": "sha256:86f34fe1b11a74387f628baee47617d9381db966b9331b258ae0698846be0cfe",
          "description": "Deep-dive analysis of a specific time range in a video. Combines burst frame extraction + transcript filtering + OCR + annotated timeline for a focused segment of the video. Use this when you need to understand exactly what happens between two timestamps: - What",
